Key differences from gradle-publish.yml

· Triggers on push/PR to main, not releases.
· Only needs contents: read for the build job.
· Adds a separate dependency-submission job with contents: write to enable Dependabot alerts.
· Does not publish artifacts — that’s what gradle-publish.yml is for.

